      "label": "Parliamentary Constituencies (Northern Ireland) Order 1970 (S.I. 1970 No. 1678)",
      "url": "https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1970/1678",
      "note": "Made 11 Nov 1970 on the Boundary Commission for Northern Ireland's report of 10 Jun 1969. The Northern Ireland Assembly Elections Order 1982 defines an Assembly constituency as the Westminster constituency in being at the election; on 20 Oct 1982 those were still this Order's twelve, the 1982 Order's seventeen not taking effect until the June 1983 general election."
